@base = http://localhost:5080

### Create a short link; optional expiresInMinutes (1-525600)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

### Link metadata incl. expiresAt
GET {{base}}/api/v1/urls/REPLACE_ME

### Redirect; expired links are gone
GET {{base}}/REPLACE_ME

### Ops
GET {{base}}/ops/stats

